Package: sc-list-pisos-fincas
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Maintainer: BENDER35 <grandrodri3@gmail.com>
Description: Local finder for flats and properties by province, town and street
 Lists flats and properties from a local JSON catalogue filtered by
 province, town or street, and builds search URLs for real-estate websites.
 Includes a didactic guide in Spanish and English and no external dependencies.
